  "name": "Arugula Fennel Salad",
  "subtitle": "Peppery greens with crisp fennel and lemon dressing",
  "description": "A bright, crunchy salad combining arugula, fennel, tomatoes, Parmesan, and toasted pine nuts with a simple lemon dressing.",
